# Implementation Plan - Fix Header Button Stacking

The goal is to fix the issue where the "All Sets" button in the modernized headers is unclickable or unresponsive. This is caused by semi-transparent background graphics (absolute-positioned elements) overlapping the button in the CSS stacking order.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The fix involves adding a small CSS update to the header content areas to lift them above the background decorations. I will also check if the button should be made visible on smaller screens (mobile) to improve navigation, as it's currently hidden there.

## Proposed Changes

### [CSS Stacking Fixes]

#### [MODIFY] [view_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_set.php) (Pokémon)
- Add `position: relative; z-index: 5;` to the `d-flex` content container in the header.

#### [MODIFY] [view_mtg_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_mtg_set.php) (Magic)
- Add `position: relative; z-index: 5;` to the `d-flex` content container in the header.

#### [MODIFY] [view_lorcana_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_set.php) (Lorcana)
- Add `position: relative; z-index: 5;` to the `d-flex` content container in the header.

#### [MODIFY] [view_onepiece_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_onepiece_set.php) (One Piece)
- Add `position: relative; z-index: 5;` to the `d-flex` content container in the header.

#### [MODIFY] [view_custom_category.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_custom_category.php) (Custom)
